      ":question/problem": "Which of the following matrices are lower triangular matrices?\n\nSelect all that apply.",
      ":question/worked-solution": "The matrices $A$, $B$ and $C$ are lower triangular matrices since all the entries above the main diagonal are zeros.\n\nThe matrices $D$ and $E$ are *not* lower triangular matrices since they each have a non-zero element above the main diagonal: \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{d}_{14} & =2\\ne 0 \\\\ {e}_{14} & =5\\ne 0\\end{aligned}\n$$",
